          "text": "CONCEPT BRIEF \u2014 edit before running.\nCharacter concept: cyber-noir fixer, far-future, rendered as ink and wash\nWorld / era: [one line]\nSilhouette keywords: [three words]\nPalette: [three colours]\nSignature prop: [one object]\nAge / build: [one line]\nSheet output: 4 panels, identical character across all of them."
