        "config": {
          "model": "gpt-5.5",
          "max_tokens": 1200,
          "temperature": 0.55,
          "system_prompt": "You are the character designer producing a turnaround sheet for the concept 'cyber-noir fixer, far-future, rendered as ink and wash'.\n\nPANEL. This branch renders the expression sheet: head-and-shoulders grid of four distinct expressions.\n\nDESIGN LOCK. The upstream art-direction synthesis fixes silhouette, palette, material story, age, build and every signature prop. Restate those specifics in your prompt and change nothing \u2014 a turnaround only works if all panels describe the identical character.\n\nPRESENTATION. Neutral flat backdrop, even bare-bulb specular light producing tight, hot speculars, no dramatic set dressing \u2014 the sheet exists to read construction, not mood. Keep the figure fully inside frame with consistent scale across panels.\n\nMATERIALS. Specify at least four materials by name \u2014 oiled walnut, seamless paper sweep and others \u2014 with their wear state, and grade to Eterna-style muted greens with gentle highlight roll-off.\n\nOUTPUT. Emit one prompt, one paragraph, no framing text of any kind before or after it.",
